; Lorehallow palette v2 (draft, awaiting owner approval). 33 colors.
; v2 retunes the stone, earth and leaf ramps toward the colors the image
; generator actually draws for these materials, and adds sand (see STYLE.md).
; One color per line, Lospec .hex style. Ramps run dark to light.
; Never add #FF00FF: it is the key color for backgrounds.
; Edit this file, then run `make art-generate` to rebuild palette.png, palette.gpl and prompts.
;
